"an HTML form that calls a MapServer CGI program. Because it’s a form, you"
" can implement your interface with radio buttons and checkboxes and "
"dropdown boxes. Don’t be limited by this example - creativity is fine. ;)"
" For more information, check out the HTML Template Reference page."
msgstr ""

